      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "私は魔が嫌いだ。魔法も、もちろん嫌いだ。\n戦いを求める者たちは魔に魅入られている。\n私の拳は破邪の拳。世に蔓延る魔を打ち砕く。\n我が元へ来い。その魂を浄化してくれよう。",
        "official_en": "Fiends. I detest them. Magic too. Those who are\ndriven to battle are in their thrall. My fists are\nrighteous purifiers of the world. Come and let me\npurify you too.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
